{
  "id": "dmw7yhcd4s77v",
  "name": "通知中心",
  "tags": [
    "提示",
    "弹窗"
  ],
  "summary": "铃铛 + 未读红点角标，点开右侧抽屉看历史消息，支持全部已读与单条已读，角标数字实时减一。",
  "usage": "需要历史记录与未读状态的消息：站内通知、审批提醒、部署结果；桌面端用抽屉。",
  "caution": "纯瞬时反馈用 Toast；未读数超过 99 显示 99+；移动端改用整页，不要抽屉。",
  "hint": "点铃铛开抽屉 · 点单条标已读 · 「全部已读」清空角标 · Esc 关闭",
  "prompt": "【通知中心】目标：铃铛 + 未读角标，点开右侧抽屉查看历史消息，支持「全部已读」和点单条已读。与 Toast 的分工：Toast 是瞬时反馈、不留历史；通知中心是有历史与未读状态的消息中心，需要回看就用它。\n1) 结构：.top（标题 + button.bell）+ .page（页面内容）；aside.drawer 为 position:fixed; top:0; right:0; max-height:100%; width:min(320px,92vw)，内部 .dh（标题 + 全部已读 + 关闭）+ ul.list > li.msg + .df（底部计数）。抽屉高度按内容自适应，内容多时由列表滚动。\n2) 抽屉动画：drawer 默认 transform:translateX(100%)，打开加 .open → translateX(0)，transition: transform .32s cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.25,1)；遮罩 opacity 0→1、.3 秒，点遮罩关闭。\n3) 未读：li.msg.unread 右侧显示 6px 圆点（--ui-brand）；.bell 内 .badge 显示未读数，超过 99 显示 99+，为 0 时整颗隐藏。角标背景 --ui-danger、文字 var(--ui-bg)，外加 2px --ui-surface 描边把角标和铃铛分开。\n4) 已读：点单条 → 去掉 unread，圆点用 el.animate 缩放淡出（220ms，fill:'forwards'），角标数字减一并对角标做一次 260ms 的 scale 弹一下；「全部已读」批量走同一套逻辑。\n5) 交互：铃铛点击切换开关（aria-expanded 同步），× 和点遮罩关闭，Esc 关闭；点列表行不关闭抽屉（用户可能连读多条）。\n6) 无障碍：铃铛 aria-expanded / aria-controls + aria-label 带未读数；抽屉 role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\"，关闭时 aria-hidden=\"true\"；列表 aria-live=\"polite\" 播报未读变化。\n7) 坑：重置自动演示时必须用 getAnimations().forEach(a=>a.cancel()) 清掉 fill:'forwards' 的动画，否则圆点被动画填充永久压住、再也不会出现；不要把图标类写成 .ico.msg 这类与 .msg 行选择器重名的 class（querySelectorAll('.msg') 会把图标一起选中）；不写死深色底，深浅主题都靠 --ui-*。\n8) 配色：抽屉与行全部用 --ui-surface / --ui-surface-2 / --ui-border / --ui-text / --ui-text-dim / --ui-brand / --ui-danger；遮罩和阴影用 color-mix，不写死 rgba。\n9) 自动演示：包在 if(!window.__uiInteractive) 里——300ms 后 cursor 移到铃铛，560ms press（同时给元素加 .pressing），190ms release 开抽屉；1 秒后点第一条未读，再点「全部已读」，最后点 × 关闭；cursor.hide() 后隔 1.7 秒复位重来。弹窗（__uiInteractive=true）里不启动任何定时器，全部交给用户点。\n10) 使用场景：写进 usage / caution。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{margin:0;min-height:100vh;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg);background:radial-gradient(760px 420px at 78% -10%,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 12%,transparent),transparent 62%),var(--ui-bg);overflow:hidden}\n.app{min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column}\n.top{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ui-border);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-surface) 65%,transparent)}\n.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600}\n.logo{width:17px;height:17px;border-radius:6px;background:var(--ui-brand)}\n.bell{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:9px;border:1px solid var(--ui-border);background:var(--ui-surface);color:var(--ui-text-dim);cursor:pointer;transition:transform .1s ease,color .18s ease,background .18s ease}\n.bell:hover{color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-surface-2)}\n.bell[aria-expanded=\"true\"]{color:var(--ui-brand)}\n.bell.pressing{transform:scale(.94)}\n.badge{position:absolute;top:-5px;right:-5px;min-width:17px;height:17px;padding:0 4px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--ui-danger);color:var(--ui-bg);font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:2px solid var(--ui-surface);box-sizing:content-box;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.badge.hide{display:none}\n.page{flex:1 1 auto;padding:12px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;overflow:hidden}\n.stats{display:flex;gap:8px}\n.stat{flex:1 1 0;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--ui-border);border-radius:10px;padding:8px 10px;background:var(--ui-surface)}\n.stat b{display:block;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.stat span{display:block;margin-top:2px;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.rows{display:flex;flex-direction:column;border:1px solid var(--ui-border);border-radius:10px;background:var(--ui-surface);overflow:hidden}\n.row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:7px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-border) 50%,transparent)}\n.row:last-child{border-bottom:0}\n.row b{flex:1 1 auto;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:400}\n.row em{flex:0 0 auto;font-style:normal;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n.mask{position:fixed;inset:0;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 26%,transparent);opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .3s ease;z-index:8}\n.mask.on{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}\n.drawer{position:fixed;top:0;right:0;max-height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;width:min(320px,92vw);background:var(--ui-surface);border-left:1px solid var(--ui-border);border-radius:0 0 0 14px;box-shadow:-18px 0 44px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 14%,transparent);transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform .32s cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.25,1);z-index:9;overflow:hidden}\n.drawer.open{transform:none}\n.dh{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:11px 13px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ui-border)}\n.dh b{flex:1 1 auto;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600}\n.readall{border:0;background:none;color:var(--ui-brand);font:inherit;font-size:11px;padding:4px 6px;border-radius:7px;cursor:pointer;transition:background .18s ease,transform .1s ease}\n.readall:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 10%,transparent)}\n.readall.pressing{transform:scale(.94)}\n.close{width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:7px;border:0;background:none;color:var(--ui-text-dim);font-size:15px;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;transition:background .18s ease,transform .1s ease}\n.close:hover{background:var(--ui-surface-2);color:var(--ui-text)}\n.close.pressing{transform:scale(.94)}\n.list{flex:0 1 auto;overflow-y:auto;list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;max-height:calc(100vh - 120px)}\n/* 细窄无箭头滚动条，统一用设计库「滚动条」那套：这里绝不能写 scrollbar-width / scrollbar-color，\n   否则 Chromium 会整体忽略 ::-webkit-scrollbar 伪元素、退回带上下箭头的系统滚动条 */\n.list::-webkit-scrollbar{width:10px;height:10px}\n.list::-webkit-scrollbar-button{display:none;width:0;height:0}\n.list::-webkit-scrollbar-track{background:transparent;margin:6px 0}\n.list::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 30%,transparent);border:3px solid transparent;border-right-width:4px;background-clip:padding-box;border-radius:999px}\n.list::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 50%,transparent);background-clip:padding-box}\n.list::-webkit-scrollbar-corner{background:transparent}\n/* Firefox 兜底：只有不认 ::-webkit-scrollbar 的浏览器才用标准属性 */\n@supports not selector(::-webkit-scrollbar){\n  .list{scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--ui-text-dim) transparent}\n}\n.msg{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;height:34px;padding:0 13px;cursor:pointer;border-bottom:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-border) 45%,transparent);transition:background .16s ease}\n.msg:last-child{border-bottom:0}\n.msg:hover,.msg.pressing{background:var(--ui-surface-2)}\n.ico{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:7px;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700}\n.ico svg{width:11px;height:11px;display:block;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.6;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}\n.ico.ok{color:var(--ui-success);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-success) 16%,transparent)}\n.ico.warn{color:var(--ui-warn);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-warn) 18%,transparent)}\n.ico.note{color:var(--ui-brand);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 14%,transparent)}\n.msg b{flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;font-size:12px;font-weight:500}\n.msg.read b{color:var(--ui-text-dim);font-weight:400}\n.msg em{flex:0 0 auto;font-style:normal;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n.dot{flex:0 0 auto;width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ui-brand)}\n.msg.read .dot{opacity:0}\n.df{flex:0 0 auto;padding:9px 13px;border-top:1px solid var(--ui-border);font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);text-align:center}\n@media (max-height:420px){\n  .top{padding:7px 11px}\n  .bell{width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:8px}\n  .drawer{width:min(300px,92vw)}\n  .dh{padding:8px 11px}\n  .list{max-height:136px}\n  .df{display:none}\n  .page{padding:9px 11px;gap:8px}\n  .rows{display:none}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"app\">\n  <header class=\"top\">\n    <div class=\"brand\"><span class=\"logo\"></span>工作台</div>\n    <button class=\"bell\" id=\"bell\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"drawer\" aria-label=\"通知中心\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 8a6 6 0 1 0-12 0c0 7-3 9-3 9h18s-3-2-3-9\"/><path d=\"M13.7 21a2 2 0 0 1-3.4 0\"/></svg>\n      <span class=\"badge\" id=\"badge\">3</span>\n    </button>\n  </header>\n  <div class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"stats\">\n      <div class=\"stat\"><b>1,280</b><span>本月访问</span></div>\n      <div class=\"stat\"><b>42</b><span>进行中任务</span></div>\n      <div class=\"stat\"><b>98%</b><span>服务可用率</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rows\">\n      <div class=\"row\"><b>设计稿已同步到项目</b><em>12 分钟前</em></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><b>新成员加入了「北岸」</b><em>1 小时前</em></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><b>部署配置已更新</b><em>昨天</em></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mask\" id=\"mask\"></div>\n<aside class=\"drawer\" id=\"drawer\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"通知中心\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <div class=\"dh\">\n    <b>通知</b>\n    <button class=\"readall\" id=\"readall\" type=\"button\">全部已读</button>\n    <button class=\"close\" id=\"close\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"关闭通知中心\">×</button>\n  </div>\n  <ul class=\"list\" id=\"list\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n    <li class=\"msg unread\"><span class=\"ico ok\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5.5 12.5l4.2 4.1 8.8-9.6\"/></svg></span><b>部署已完成</b><em>2 分钟前</em><i class=\"dot\"></i></li>\n    <li class=\"msg unread\"><span class=\"ico warn\">!</span><b>存储空间剩余 8%</b><em>26 分钟前</em><i class=\"dot\"></i></li>\n    <li class=\"msg unread\"><span class=\"ico note\">≡</span><b>周叙 回复了你的评论</b><em>1 小时前</em><i class=\"dot\"></i></li>\n    <li class=\"msg read\"><span class=\"ico note\">≡</span><b>本月账单已生成</b><em>昨天</em><i class=\"dot\"></i></li>\n    <li class=\"msg read\"><span class=\"ico ok\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5.5 12.5l4.2 4.1 8.8-9.6\"/></svg></span><b>备份任务已完成</b><em>昨天</em><i class=\"dot\"></i></li>\n    <li class=\"msg read\"><span class=\"ico warn\">!</span><b>有 2 个任务即将到期</b><em>2 天前</em><i class=\"dot\"></i></li>\n  </ul>\n  <div class=\"df\">全部通知 · 共 6 条</div>\n</aside>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var bell=document.getElementById('bell'),\n      badge=document.getElementById('badge'),\n      mask=document.getElementById('mask'),\n      drawer=document.getElementById('drawer'),\n      list=document.getElementById('list'),\n      readall=document.getElementById('readall'),\n      closeBtn=document.getElementById('close');\n  var msgs=[].slice.call(list.querySelectorAll('.msg'));\n\n  function unreadCount(){ return list.querySelectorAll('.msg.unread').length; }\n  function setBadge(){\n    var n=unreadCount();\n    badge.textContent=n>99?'99+':String(n);\n    badge.classList.toggle('hide',n===0);\n    bell.setAttribute('aria-label','通知中心（'+n+' 条未读）');\n    if(n>0) badge.animate([{transform:'scale(1)'},{transform:'scale(1.18)'},{transform:'scale(1)'}],{duration:260,easing:'ease-out'});\n  }\n  function openDrawer(){\n    drawer.classList.add('open');\n    mask.classList.add('on');\n    drawer.setAttribute('aria-hidden','false');\n    bell.setAttribute('aria-expanded','true');\n  }\n  function closeDrawer(){\n    drawer.classList.remove('open');\n    mask.classList.remove('on');\n    drawer.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');\n    bell.setAttribute('aria-expanded','false');\n  }\n  function killDot(row){\n    var dot=row.querySelector('.dot');\n    if(dot&&dot.getAnimations) dot.getAnimations().forEach(function(a){ a.cancel(); });\n  }\n  function markRead(row){\n    if(!row||!row.classList.contains('unread')) return;\n    row.classList.remove('unread');\n    row.classList.add('read');\n    row.querySelector('.dot').animate([{opacity:1,transform:'scale(1)'},{opacity:0,transform:'scale(0)'}],{duration:220,easing:'ease-in',fill:'forwards'});\n    setBadge();\n  }\n  function markAll(){\n    msgs.forEach(function(row){ if(row.classList.contains('unread')) markRead(row); });\n  }\n  function resetAll(){\n    msgs.forEach(function(row,i){\n      killDot(row);\n      row.classList.toggle('unread',i<3);\n      row.classList.toggle('read',i>=3);\n    });\n    closeDrawer();\n    setBadge();\n  }\n\n  bell.addEventListener('click',function(){\n    if(drawer.classList.contains('open')) closeDrawer(); else openDrawer();\n  });\n  closeBtn.addEventListener('click',closeDrawer);\n  mask.addEventListener('click',closeDrawer);\n  readall.addEventListener('click',markAll);\n  list.addEventListener('click',function(e){\n    var row=e.target.closest?e.target.closest('.msg'):null;\n    if(row) markRead(row);\n  });\n  document.addEventListener('keydown',function(e){\n    if(e.key==='Escape'&&drawer.classList.contains('open')) closeDrawer();\n  });\n\n  var cursor=null,timers=[];\n  function later(ms,fn){ timers.push(setTimeout(fn,ms)); }\n  function clearTimers(){ timers.forEach(clearTimeout); timers=[]; }\n  function play(){\n    if(window.__uiInteractive) return;\n    clearTimers();\n    resetAll();\n    var r=bell.getBoundingClientRect();\n    if(!r.width||!r.height){ later(300,play); return; }\n    if(!cursor&&typeof window.__uiDemoCursor==='function') cursor=window.__uiDemoCursor();\n    if(!cursor){\n      openDrawer();\n      later(1100,function(){ markAll(); later(900,function(){ closeDrawer(); later(1600,play); }); });\n      return;\n    }\n    if(cursor.el) cursor.el.classList.add('show');\n    var row=list.querySelector('.msg.unread');\n    later(300,function(){\n      cursor.moveTo(bell);\n      later(560,function(){\n        cursor.press(); bell.classList.add('pressing');\n        later(190,function(){\n          cursor.release(); bell.classList.remove('pressing');\n          openDrawer();\n          later(1000,function(){\n            cursor.moveTo(row);\n            later(560,function(){\n              cursor.press(); row.classList.add('pressing');\n              later(190,function(){\n                cursor.release(); row.classList.remove('pressing');\n                markRead(row);\n                later(900,function(){\n                  cursor.moveTo(readall);\n                  later(560,function(){\n                    cursor.press(); readall.classList.add('pressing');\n                    later(190,function(){\n                      cursor.release(); readall.classList.remove('pressing');\n                      markAll();\n                      later(950,function(){\n                        cursor.moveTo(closeBtn);\n                        later(560,function(){\n                          cursor.press(); closeBtn.classList.add('pressing');\n                          later(190,function(){\n                            cursor.release(); closeBtn.classList.remove('pressing');\n                            closeDrawer();\n                            later(500,function(){ cursor.hide(); later(1700,play); });\n                          });\n                        });\n                      });\n                    });\n                  });\n                });\n              });\n            });\n          });\n        });\n      });\n    });\n  }\n  resetAll();\n  play();\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>",
